x86/microcode/AMD: Add get_patch_level()

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Borislav Petkov (AMD) <bp@alien8.de>
commit 037e81fb9d2dfe7b31fd97e5f578854e38f09887
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/037e81fb.failed

Put the MSR_AMD64_PATCH_LEVEL reading of the current microcode revision
the hw has, into a separate function.

	Signed-off-by: Borislav Petkov (AMD) <bp@alien8.de>
	Reviewed-by: Thomas Gleixner <tglx@linutronix.de>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20250211163648.30531-6-bp@kernel.org
(cherry picked from commit 037e81fb9d2dfe7b31fd97e5f578854e38f09887)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

